---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import JoinFreeAndContribute from '../components/JoinFreeAndContribute.astro';
import SharePerspective from '../components/SharePerspective.astro';
import StayInformedForm from '../components/StayInformedForm.vue';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<Layout title="The Playbook for America">

  <main>

    <header class="bg-p4a-bg0 relative">
      <div class="container pt-16 md:pt-12 pb-28 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl text-p4a-bg4 font-bold leading-12 md:leading-16 lg:leading-20 lg:tracking-tight">
            <!-- Connecting people to ideas — and ideas to <span class="text-white">real results</span>. -->
            <!-- Providing concerned Americans with an effective way to turn civic problems into effective solutions -->
            A simple way to help turn civic problems into <span class="text-white">real solutions</span>.
          </h1>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
          <h2 class="pb-4 text-xl lg:text-2xl text-white font-semibold leading-10 lg:leading-14 tracking-wide">
            <!-- Playbook for America is a nonpartisan platform that turns crowdsourced ideas into execution-ready Playbooks — ready to turn confident action into measurable results. -->
            <!-- Playbook for America is a nonpartisan platform where citizens can surface problems, strengthen ideas, and help shape execution-ready Playbooks built for measurable results. -->
            <!-- Playbook for America is a nonpartisan platform that helps citizens identify important problems, shape strong solutions, and turn the best ideas into practical Playbooks for real-world action. -->
            <!-- Playbook for America is a nonpartisan platform that helps citizens identify problems worth solving, strengthen promising ideas, and turn the best ones into practical Playbooks for action. -->
            Playbook for America is a nonpartisan platform that helps citizens identify problems worth solving, shape strong solutions, and turn the best ones into execution ready Playbooks.
          </h2>
          <JoinFreeAndContribute />
        </div>
      </div>
      <svg class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full" viewBox="0 0 1440 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="height: 60px;">
        <path fill="#d4defc" d="M0,32 C240,60 480,60 720,32 C960,4 1200,4 1440,32 L1440,60 L0,60 Z"></path>
      </svg>
    </header>
    
    <div class="mb-12 mt-6 text-center">
      <div class="mx-4 inline-block py-4 px-8 bg-white/70 border border-p4a-bg2 shadow-md rounded-4xl">
        <p class="text-p4a-bg2 font-semibold"><a class="hover:text-p4a-bg4 underline hover:decoration-2" href="/focus-areas">Explore our focus areas</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-4 inline-block py-4 px-8 bg-white/70 border border-p4a-bg2 shadow-md rounded-4xl">
        <p class="text-p4a-bg2 font-semibold"><a class="hover:text-p4a-bg4 underline hover:decoration-2" href="/volunteer">Volunteer to help build P4A</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="container pb-8">

      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-18 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Turning your insight into real impact</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          On Playbook for America, a concern you raise can grow into an idea, and a strong idea can grow into a coordinated plan for action. Our three connected building blocks give citizen input a clear path from public problem to real-world results.
          <!-- Every contribution fits into a clear path forward. Issues define problems, Ideas propose solutions, and Playbooks turn promising ideas into action and outcomes. -->
          <!-- Playbook for America is built around three connected building blocks. <span class="font-bold uppercase text-p4a-bg2">Issues</span> define problems. <span class="font-bold uppercase text-p4a-bg2">Ideas</span> propose solutions. 
          <span class="font-bold uppercase text-p4a-bg2">Playbooks</span> turn strong ideas into coordinated action and measurable outcomes. -->
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr] items-stretch gap-2">
          <div class="bg-p4a-body rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-bg1">
            <div class="bg-p4a-bg1 py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:hand-palm" /> Issue</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">A clearly defined public <span class="font-bold uppercase text-p4a-bg2">problem</span> that deserves attention, understanding, and targeted solutions.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 hidden md:block" name="ph:arrow-right-bold" />
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 md:hidden" name="ph:arrow-down-bold" />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-p4a-body rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-bg1">
            <div class="bg-p4a-bg1 py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:lightbulb" /> Idea</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">A proposed <span class="font-bold uppercase text-p4a-bg2">solution</span> to an Issue which is ready to be discussed, improved, and strengthened.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 hidden md:block" name="ph:arrow-right-bold" />
            <Icon class="text-3xl text-p4a-bg2 md:hidden" name="ph:arrow-down-bold" />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-p4a-body rounded shadow-md border border-p4a-bg1">
            <div class="bg-p4a-bg1 py-1 text-xl text-white text-center font-bold rounded-t">
              <div class="justify-center flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="ph:book-open-text" /> Playbook</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 text-sm sm:text-center">An execution-ready <span class="font-bold uppercase text-p4a-bg2">plan</span> that turns strong Ideas into coordinated action, ownership, and measurable results.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-18 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">No policy expertise required</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          On Playbook for America, you simply describe a civic problem or solution idea in your own words in an easy and intuitive form. Our AI expands your input into a clearer, more structured draft others can understand, discuss, strengthen, and build upon.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center text-p4a-bg2">
          <Icon class="text-4xl text-p4a-bg3" name="ph:note-pencil" />
          <p class="font-bold text-xl text-p4a-bg2">Simply say what you’ve seen. We’ll make sure your voice is heard.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-18 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">How Ideas turn into a better America</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
           Playbook for America helps move public problems from citizen input to stronger ideas, execution-ready Playbooks, followed by adoption, execution, and evaluation.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 mb-4 items-start">
          <div class="">
            <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center">
              <Icon class="text-4xl text-p4a-bg4" name="ph:number-circle-one-fill" />
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-p4a-bg2">Surface important public problems</div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-10">
              All Americans can report Issues deserving attention and action. These reports help define problems clearly enough for others to understand, discuss, and respond to.
              <a class="underline hover:decoration-2" href="/file-a-report">Anonymous reporting is also supported</a>.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-p4a-bg1 flex flex-row gap-2 mb-4 items-start">
          <div class="">
            <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center">
              <Icon class="text-4xl text-p4a-bg4" name="ph:number-circle-two-fill" />
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-p4a-bg2">Strengthen promising solutions</div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-10">
              <!-- Strong ideas are shaped into into structured Playbooks with implentation phases, scope, requirements, risks, and success metrics—so an entity can decide, fund, and execute. -->
              <!-- Strong ideas are shaped into structured Playbooks with implementation phases, scope, requirements, risks, and success metrics—so an entity can decide, fund, and execute. AI tools assist with research, identifying gaps, and expanding rough proposals into clearer implementation plans. -->
               Community members can propose Ideas in response to Issues, then discuss, refine, and strengthen them together. The strongest Ideas become clearer, more actionable starting points for real-world progress.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-p4a-bg1 flex flex-row gap-2 mb-4 items-start">
          <div class="">
            <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center">
              <Icon class="text-4xl text-p4a-bg4" name="ph:number-circle-three-fill" />
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-p4a-bg2">Turn strong ideas into Playbooks</div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-10">
              <!-- Public and private entities commit to Playbooks, assign ownership and resources, and move from plan to program with defined scope and measurable outcomes. -->
               Promising Ideas can be developed into Playbooks with clear implementation phases, scope, requirements, risks, ownership, and success measures — making them easier for capable entities to evaluate, fund, and execute.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-p4a-bg1 flex flex-row gap-2 items-start">
          <div class="">
            <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center">
              <Icon class="text-4xl text-p4a-bg4" name="ph:number-circle-four-fill" />
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-p4a-bg2">Learn from execution and outcomes</div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-10">
              <!-- Results are tracked against Playbook projections, strengthening future Playbooks and improving outcomes over time. -->
               As Playbooks move into execution, outcomes can be tracked against expectations. What works can be built on, what falls short can be improved, and future Playbooks can benefit from what is learned.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-18 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Why it matters</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center text-p4a-bg2">
          <Icon class="text-4xl" name="ph:megaphone" />
          <p class="font-bold text-xl text-p4a-bg2">Your ideas have a place here</p>
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
           America needs your energy, your ideas and our collective intelligence — while facilitating better ways to understand one another. Playbook for America creates a space for constructive participation and serious exchange.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center text-p4a-bg2">
          <Icon class="text-4xl" name="ph:chats-circle" />
          <p class="font-bold text-xl text-p4a-bg2">Better technology for real progress</p>
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Too often, good ideas get lost in noise, partisanship, or unclear paths to implementation. Discussion is easy. Designing systems that transform ideas into action is harder.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center text-p4a-bg2">
          <Icon class="text-4xl" name="ph:handshake" />
           <p class="font-bold text-xl">Ideas should lead somewhere</p>
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Strong democracies don’t just generate discussion — they move ideas from debate to delivery. Playbook for America provides the structured lifecycle aligning citizens and institutions which make measurable public benefit possible.
        </p>
      </section>
      
      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-18 text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Independent. Nonpartisan. Built for impact.</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Playbook for America is an independent, nonpartisan nonprofit structured to serve the public interest — not private gain — and to strengthen civic infrastructure over the long term.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We surface high-signal ideas, strengthen them through disciplined, structured review, bringing execution-ready Playbooks to agencies and organizations positioned to implement.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We collaborate with partners committed to strengthening civic infrastructure, improving signal-to-noise in public problem solving, and advancing accountable, measurable public outcomes.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-2">
          We partner with:
        </p>
        <ul class="ml-6 list-disc marker:text-p4a-bg2 marker:text-2xl">
          <li><span class="font-semibold">Funders — </span>advancing high-leverage civic infrastructure with disciplined refinement and measurable outcomes</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold">Public officials — </span>seeking execution-ready proposals grounded in broad civic input</li>
          <li><span class="font-semibold">Civic organizations — </span>committed to responsible collaboration, alignment, and real-world delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
        

        <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-p4a-bg1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Get involved</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-md shadow-lg bg-p4a-body border border-p4a-bg2 flex flex-col">
            <div class="grow">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Share your perspective</h3>
              <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                We're evaluating whether Playbook for America is desirable, viable, and worth pursuing.
                Your participation will help us shape the future of civic participation.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-1 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
                In this short survey, you'll weigh in on:
              </p>
              <ul class="mb-4 ml-2">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon class="text-lg text-p4a-bg2" name="ph:check-square" /> <span>What similar systems exist</span></li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon class="text-lg text-p4a-bg2" name="ph:check-square" /> <span>If this feels compelling</span></li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon class="text-lg text-p4a-bg2" name="ph:check-square" /> <span>Any concerns you may have</span></li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon class="text-lg text-p4a-bg2" name="ph:check-square" /> <span>Your likelihood of participating</span></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <p class="mb-2 leading-relaxed text-sm text-center">
              Anonymous, all viewpoints encouraged.
            </p>
            <a
              href="/feedback"
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full bg-p4a-bg1 hover:bg-p4a-bg2 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-md transition-colors"
            >
              Take the 2-minute survey <Icon class="text-xl" name="ph:arrow-right" />
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-md shadow-lg bg-p4a-body border border-p4a-bg2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Stay informed</h3>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Get occasional updates as the platform develops. No spam, just meaningful progress.
            </p>
            <StayInformedForm client:load />
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </section>
      
    </div>
  </main>
  
</Layout>
<!-- <p class="leading-relaxed mb-2">
  Help shape the future of Playbook for America. Share your perspective, stay informed as the platform develops, or express interest in contributing your time or expertise.
</p> -->
